</tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_ophost</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opapi</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/2752/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-03-16 15:02:10] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-03-16T14:56:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T15:02:11+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165362008,"discussion_id":"60f1ee8b36f0b9a864785a32ddd105e1cead85cf","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要对AscendC算子`InplaceIndexAddDeterminsticNotQuant`进行了两项关键优化。首先，修复了确定性原位索引加法内核在优化路径下索引队列缓冲区大小计算错误的问题，并调整了反量化输出阶段的硬件事件同步顺序，以消除潜在的竞态条件并确保数据一致性。其次，重构了核心处理函数中的局部张量管理和数据流控制逻辑，旨在优化UB资源复用、减少等待开销，从而提升算子的整体执行效率和资源利用率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含两部分核心内容。其一，在`ProcessThirdStepOpti`函数中，将`sumIdxQue_`缓冲区的初始化大小从`rowMainDataLen * afterAxisAlignSize_ * sizeof(IDX_T)`更正为`rowMainDataLen * sizeof(IDX_T)`，使其与实际使用的索引数据长度匹配，避免了不必要的内存分配。同时，在`CopyInverseQuantizedValueOut`函数中，调整了`Muls`操作与`V_MTE3`硬件事件的设置/等待顺序，以符合硬件同步的最佳实践。其二，重构了`ProcessPreSmallIndices`、`ProcessPreSingleLoop`和`ProcessAfterSingleLoop`函数，将局部张量从一次性分配改为循环内按需分配与释放，并将原子操作的设置移出内层循环，配合`PipeBarrier<PIPE_MTE3>`确保数据一致性，从而优化了数据流和资源管理。","created_at":"2026-03-16T14:56:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T14:56:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165396968,"discussion_id":"154551d107ab0c00b32a22b0af0f18430ea8310f","body":"这个atomic设置还是循环里的，要避免在循环里频繁开关atomic，否则可能存在精度问题","created_at":"2026-03-16T17:30:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T17:10:12+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c8bee4b985165b4b0686","login":"fanqirui","object_id":"6822c8bee4b985165b4b0686","name":"范其瑞","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ce/fc0c4ea3a1475e7c17f62a0f56f5cc495303247ae65117dc587acd502be1f96c.png?time=1753758215470","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/fanqirui"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68abc1ea0f820658f05c100a","login":"jinpenghe","object_id":"68abc1ea0f820658f05c100a","name":"jinpenghe","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/db/7a9c5d737bf8da0ecb92e0cf3ee5c8dc68250629ebcdc54d2febaae600c67b83.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jinpenghe"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":312,"end_new_line":312,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":165519761,"body"